// status: valid-now
// feature: naming a vault with `--vault` does not activate `hmd`: plain HQL refuses `cards` and a document reference, each naming `import hmd`
// implementation: implemented
// environment: pure
// session: cli
// exit: 1

$ hql --vault examples/projects/notes run examples/projects/queries/invalid-cards-without-hmd.hql
check error[unknown-name]: `cards` is HyperMarkdown's: write `import hmd`, or run with `--import hmd`, to bind it
 --> examples/projects/queries/invalid-cards-without-hmd.hql:9:1
  |
9 | cards | count
  | ^^^^^

$ hql --vault examples/projects/notes run examples/projects/queries/invalid-reference-without-hmd.hql
check error[unknown-name]: `@[[owl]]` is a HyperMarkdown document reference: write `import hmd`, or run with `--import hmd`, to resolve it
 --> examples/projects/queries/invalid-reference-without-hmd.hql:9:1
  |
9 | @[[owl]]
  | ^^^^^^^^

